{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Concrete Spaces is an interactive poetry collection,\u00a0that plays with creating and destroying spatial expectations, spoken word inspired pacing, and bilinguality.</i>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 interactive audiovisual poems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Implied, yet completely unforced linearity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mainly written in English, with some Finnish texts in the mix. (can be fully experienced without understanding the language)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single playthrough taking 20-40 minutes, depending on your pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optionless; windowed mode and keyboard input only.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Disclaimer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Although the game offers some replay value, if you're looking for a time-sink, this game is probably not for you. As this game was solo developed, there's still a possibility for bugs, if encountered, reload the currently open Space! Thanks.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3580760?t=1742161710","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3580760?t=1742161710","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580760/88ef61c2b1a1c494a51a846ac440b9d421051d52/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742161710","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580760/88ef61c2b1a1c494a51a846ac440b9d421051d52/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742161710","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Concrete Spaces is an interactive poetry collection,\u00a0that plays with creating and destroying spatial expectations, spoken word inspired pacing, and bilinguality.</i>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 interactive audiovisual poems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Implied, yet completely unforced linearity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mainly written in English, with some Finnish texts in the mix. (can be fully experienced without understanding the language)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single playthrough taking 20-40 minutes, depending on your pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optionless; windowed mode and keyboard input only.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Disclaimer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Although the game offers some replay value, if you're looking for a time-sink, this game is probably not for you. As this game was solo developed, there's still a possibility for bugs, if encountered, reload the currently open Space! Thanks.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Samuli Pietik\u00e4inen"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580760/e3e3dc1d50512d8ab1d96479c07fc9d105a13bfb/header.jpg?t=1742161710","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257115169,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115169/movie480.mp4?t=1742161693","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115169/movie_max.mp4?t=1742161693"},"name":"reveal trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257115169/9188cd9ca83299a233fc8c98127fa0969c124a16/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742161693","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115169/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742161693","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115169/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742161693"}}],"name":"Concrete Spaces","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":